# Auto-deploy to Vercel

After finishing a successful turn that changed any website files (`index.html`, `agilix-collective/**`, assets, CSS/JS, etc.):

1. Run production deploy before ending:
   ```bash
   npm run deploy
   ```
   (This runs `npx --yes vercel --prod --yes`.)
2. If deploy fails, report the error and point to `.cursor/deploy-log.txt`.
3. Do not skip deploy because Cursor hooks might also deploy — hooks are a backup; still run `npm run deploy` after site edits.
4. Skip deploy only when the turn made **no** website file changes (questions, planning-only, etc.).
